      },
      "estleg:versionText": "Tarbijale edastatakse tarbimisandmed alljärgneva vormi kohaselt. <table> <tr> <td colspan=\"4\"><p><b>Maagaasi tarbimisandmed mõõtepunkti kohta</b></p></td></tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"4\"><p>Mõõtepunkti aadress:</p></td></tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"4\"><p>Arvestusperioodi maagaasi keskmine ülemine kütteväärtus (MWh/m³):</p></td></tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"4\">&#160;</td></tr> </table> <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 50%\"> <tr> <td><div>&#160;</div></td> <td width=\"20%\"><div align=\"center\"><b>Algnäit</b></div></td> <td width=\"20%\"><div align=\"center\"><b>Lõppnäit</b></div></td> <td width=\"30%\"><div align=\"center\"><b>Tarbimismaht (m³)</b></div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Jaanuar</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Veebruar</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Märts</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Aprill</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Mai</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Juuni</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Juuli</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>August</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>September</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Oktoober</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>November</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> <tr> <td><div><b>Detsember</b></div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td> <td><div align=\"center\">&#160;</div></td></tr> </table> Tarbijale edastatakse tarbimisandmed alljärgneva vormi kohaselt.",
